<p style="Heading 1" xid="96" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">Database connection<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="97" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="98" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">- goto mongoDb atlas<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="99" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">-  create a project<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="100" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="101" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="102" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">cluster passowrd and user name <c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="103" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="104" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">write2ravi14 - user<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="105" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">JPqn0F6hBJtLMUxT  -pass<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="106" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="107" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">///Go to option security - quickstart<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="108" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="109" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">choose username and passowrd <c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="110" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="111" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">- select local envoirnment<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="112" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">- IP adress - 0.0.0.0/0<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="113" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">- delete the existing ip\<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="114" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="115" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">click on save <c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="116" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">---------------<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="117" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="118" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">important to check 2 things before starting <c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="119" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="120" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">Security - left side panel<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="121" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">  - Network access <c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="122" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"> - databse acces - here we should have user createdwith R/W access<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="123" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="124" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">-------------------------------------------<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="125" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">nex -<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="126" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">on left panel<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="128" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="127" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">deplayment database   or databse cluster<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="129" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="130" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="131" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">pop up will open with Connect to cluster 0<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="132" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="133" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">-select compass<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="134" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">- 2. Copy the connection string, then open MongoDB Compass<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="135" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="136" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">mongodb+srv://write2ravi14:&lt;db_password&gt;@cluster0.nxego31.mongodb.net/<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="137" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="140" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">-----------------------------------------<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="141" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="145" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="146" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="147" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c>ADD THE URL AND PASSWORD IN .env FILE</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="142" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="143" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">PORT=8000<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="144" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">MONGODB_URI=mongodb+srv://write2ravi14:JPqn0F6hBJtLMUxT@cluster0.nxego31.mongodb.net<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="148" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="149" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">---------------------------------<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="150" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">mention and create export the database in constants.js<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="152" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="153" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">export const DB_NAME = "videotube"<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="151" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">-----------------------------------------</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="154" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="155" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">Need further more packages installation which are required as of now for the project</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="156" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="157" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">npm install mongoose express dotenv</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="158" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="159" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">--------------------------------------------</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="160" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="161" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">Points to take care while connecting DB</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="162" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="163" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">1. <c props="font-weight:bold">Try catch</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c> - Always wrap DB connection in the try catch so that if any error then easily it will be handled </p>
<p style="Normal" xid="164" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">2. <c props="font-weight:bold">Async await</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c> - Database would be in diff continental and your code base can be in diff, so when you try talking to the DB it takes time. Hence its better approach that use async await while speaking with DB</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="165" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="190" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="191" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="166" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">constants.js</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="185" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="188" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">export const DB_NAME=”videotube”</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="186" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="184" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="168" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">-db(folder)</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="169" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">   - index.js</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="170" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="171" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="192" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="193" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="194" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="195" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="196" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="197" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="198" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="199" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="200" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="201" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="172" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">index.js (inside db folder) - create a database connection here</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="173" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="189" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">import {DB_NAME} from ‘../constants.js’;</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="174" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">import mongoose from ‘mongoose’;</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="202" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">import dotenv from ‘dotenv’</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="203" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">dotenv.config();</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="175" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="176" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="177" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">export const connectDB = async() =&gt;{</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="178" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">    try{</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="182" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">   const connectionInstance = mongoose.connect(‘${process.env.MONGODB_URI}/${DB_NAME}’)</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="183" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic"></c><c props="font-style:italic">}</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="180" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">catch(e){</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="204" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">console.error(“Error in DB connection”, error);</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="211" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">process.exit(1);</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="181" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic"></c><c props="font-style:italic">}</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="179" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic"></c><c props="font-style:italic">}</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="205" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic"></c><c props="font-style:italic">------------------------------------------------------------------------</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="240" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">app.js - create express app and export it from here</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="244" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="245" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">import express from ‘express’</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="246" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="247" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">const app = express();</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="248" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="249" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">export default app;</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="250" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="251" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">------------------------------------------------</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="242" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic"></c><c props="font-style:italic">index.js</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="207" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="208" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">import {connectDB} from ‘./db/index.js’</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="209" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">import app from ‘./app.js’</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="255" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">import dotenv from ‘dotenv’</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="256" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">ditenv.config();</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="221" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="263" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">const PORT = process.env.PORT || 5000;</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="225" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; lang:en-US">connectDB()</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; lang:en-US"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="259" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; lang:en-US">.then(()=&gt;{</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; lang:en-US"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="261" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; lang:en-US">   app.listen(PORT,()=&gt;{</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; lang:en-US"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="264" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; lang:en-US">console.log(“Server started on port =”, PORT);})</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; lang:en-US"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="265" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; lang:en-US"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="266" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; lang:en-US">app.on(“error",(err)=&gt;{</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; lang:en-US"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="267" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; lang:en-US">console.log(“Error while starting server: ”, err);</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; lang:en-US"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="268" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; lang:en-US"></c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; lang:en-US">})  })</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="260" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; lang:en-US">.catch((error)=&gt;{console.log(“Issue with server starting:”, error); throws error;})</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; lang:en-US"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="213" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="226" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic"></c><c props="font-style:italic">*************************************************</c></p>
<p style="Heading 2" xid="270" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">So far what we have done:</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="272" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">1. written DB connection in db&gt;index.js</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="273" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">2. created express server in app.js</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="274" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">3. index.js - we have called DB connection function and initiated connection,  then() - is connection succesfulll then() part of the function will excute where started the server. </p>
<p style="Heading 3" xid="271" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c>Project moving forward.....</p>
<p style="Heading 1" xid="299" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">middlewares</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="367" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="368" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">what is a middleware?</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="369" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">-&gt; middleware is the function which will exceute at server side on req and res. </p>
<p style="Normal" xid="370" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="387" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">middleware written as below:</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="388" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="389" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">function middleware(err, req, res, next)</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="386" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="371" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">The position of midleware in flow is as below:<br/><br/>req:  </p>
<p style="Normal" xid="373" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="374" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c>client sent data over stream</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="372" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">   =&gt; raw Stream</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="375" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">     =&gt; middleware parses</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="376" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">       =&gt; req.body created</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="377" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">         =&gt; route handler and server perform action on req. </p>
<p style="Normal" xid="378" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="379" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">res:</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="380" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="381" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">route handler calls res methods</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="382" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">    =&gt; res object created </p>
<p style="Normal" xid="383" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">      =&gt; middleware (transform or add token to response)</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="384" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">       =&gt; raw  stream sent to client. </p>
<p style="Normal" xid="385" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="275" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="300" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c>Working forward on express, main focus in express will be req and res. </p>
<p style="Normal" xid="281" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="282" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">working worward on request part of the express. </p>
<p style="Normal" xid="279" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="280" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c>installed <c props="font-weight:bold">cors</c> and <c props="font-weight:bold">cookie-parser</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="283" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="761" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">cookie-parser</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="763" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="764" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="762" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="284" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">app.use - </c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c props="font-weight:normal">it will be used for the middleware</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="276" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="278" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="277" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold; bgcolor:80ff80">cors</c><c props="font-weight:bold; bgcolor:80ff80"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="286" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold; bgcolor:80ff80"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="287" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal; bgcolor:ffffff">cors is a middleware and will be initited using app. </c><c props="font-weight:normal; bgcolor:ffffff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="288" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal; bgcolor:ffffff"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="292" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal; bgcolor:ffffff">//its simple form to mention the cors</c><c props="font-weight:normal; bgcolor:ffffff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="289" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal; bgcolor:ffffff">app.use(cors()); </c><c props="font-weight:normal; bgcolor:ffffff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="290" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal; bgcolor:ffffff"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="291" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal; bgcolor:ffffff">//advanced form to mention the cors, env need to set or use direct value here</c><c props="font-weight:normal; bgcolor:ffffff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="293" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal; bgcolor:ffffff">app.use(cors({</c><c props="font-weight:normal; bgcolor:ffffff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="294" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal; bgcolor:ffffff">origin:process.env.CORS_ORIGIN,</c><c props="font-weight:normal; bgcolor:ffffff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="296" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal; bgcolor:ffffff">credentials:true</c><c props="font-weight:normal; bgcolor:ffffff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="295" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal; bgcolor:ffffff"></c><c props="font-weight:normal; bgcolor:ffffff">}))</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="285" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="301" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">**************************************</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="302" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">json file limit</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="303" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="304" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">express.json()</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="305" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="306" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal">express.json() is a middleware that parses the incoming JSON payloads in the request body. </c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="307" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="308" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal">can customise the properties as below:</c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="309" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="310" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal">1) </c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c props="font-weight:bold">limit</c><c props="font-weight:normal"> : ”16kb”</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="311" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal">2) </c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c props="font-weight:bold">strict</c><c props="font-weight:normal">: true </c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="312" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal">   If its true then accept only json objects and arrays</c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="313" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal">   if its false then accept primitive JSON values like number and string.</c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="314" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="315" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal">3) </c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c props="font-weight:bold">reviver</c><c props="font-weight:normal">   - its a function that can transform the parsed json values before putting them in req.body.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="297" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="316" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">   </c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c props="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal">app.use(express.json({</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="317" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal">reviver:(key, value)=&gt;{</c><c props="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="318" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal"> if( typeof value ==="String”) return value.toUpperCase();</c><c props="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="320" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal">return value;</c><c props="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="319" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal"></c><c props="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal">}}))</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="298" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="323" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal">4) </c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c props="font-weight:bold">type</c><c props="font-weight:normal"> - determine which requests are parsed.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="324" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="325" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal">default ‘application/json’</c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="326" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="327" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal">If client sends data in form of req like text/html then have to add the middleware here in order to parse the in text/html format</c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="328" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="329" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal">5. </c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c props="font-weight:bold">inflate</c> - it will automatically decompress gzipped or dflated request bodies. </p>
<p style="Normal" xid="330" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="331" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"> default is true <c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="332" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="333" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">app.use(express.json({<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="334" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">  limit: '1mb',<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="335" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">  strict: true,<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="336" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">  reviver: null,<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="337" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">  type: 'application/json',<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="338" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">  inflate: true<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="339" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">}));<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="340" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="341" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="342" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">*****************************************<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="343" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="344" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">app.use(express.urlencoded({extended:true, limit:”16kb”}))<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="345" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="347" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="348" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">This middleware used to parse application/x-www=urlencoded request.</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="349" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="350" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">example data which will come in url</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="351" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="352" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">username=ravi&amp;age=28</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="353" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="354" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">after parsing, express puut it in req.body</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="355" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="356" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">req.body = {username:"ravi”, age:”28”}</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="359" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">**********************</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="364" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">app.use(express.static(“public”))</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="390" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="391" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">-----------------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="392" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="393" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">create below mentioned util functions in file </p>
<p style="Normal" xid="394" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="395" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">ApiError.js</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="396" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">ApiResponse.js</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="397" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">asyncHandler.js</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="398" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="399" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="400" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">***************************************************************************</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="401" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">***************************************************************************</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="402" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="404" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">Create a model in mongoose. </p>
<p style="Normal" xid="405" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="406" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">user.model.js</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="407" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">video.model.js</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="408" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="409" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">--------------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="410" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="411" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="412" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Heading 3" xid="413" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">mongoose-aggregate-paginate-v2</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="414" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="415" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">Need to install above package</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c>. </p>
<p style="Normal" xid="416" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="417" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">Use Case</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c> - <c props="font-style:italic">Suppose you have 1000 users in your MongoDB collection.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="420" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="421" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffff80">Without pagination:</c><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffff80"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="423" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="424" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">GET /users</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="425" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">[</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="426" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">  { "id": 1, "name": "Ravi" },</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="427" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">  { "id": 2, "name": "John" },</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="428" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">  ...</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="429" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">  { "id": 1000, "name": "Alex" }</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="430" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">]</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="432" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="433" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff">This would send all </c><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff"></c><c props="bgcolor:ffffff; font-weight:bold; font-style:italic">1000</c><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff"> records at once (slow + heavy for client)</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="434" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="463" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff"></c><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffff80">with pagination</c><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff">  limit = </c><c props="bgcolor:ffffff; font-weight:bold; font-style:italic">10 </c><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff">per page</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="437" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="464" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff"></c><c props="bgcolor:ffffff; font-weight:bold; font-style:italic">GET/users?page=1&amp;limit=10</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="441" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="442" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff">response from database would be as below<br/><br/></c><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff"></c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">{</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="443" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">  "docs": [</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="444" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">    { "id": 1, "name": "Ravi" },</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="445" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">    { "id": 2, "name": "John" },</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="446" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">    ...</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="447" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">    { "id": 10, "name": "Alex" }</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="448" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">  ],</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="449" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">  "page": 1,</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="450" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">  "totalPages": 100</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="451" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">}</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="452" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="439" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff">Client get 10 users at a time and if required client can request for more.</c><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="453" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="454" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff">- </c><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff"></c><c props="bgcolor:ffffff; font-weight:bold; font-style:italic">Perfomance</c><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff"> : Pagination improve prformance and dont overload server or client with huge data dump.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="455" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="456" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff">- </c><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff"></c><c props="bgcolor:ffffff; font-weight:bold; font-style:italic">Faster Loading</c><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff">: Only some part of data being fetched</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="457" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="458" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff">- </c><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff"></c><c props="bgcolor:ffffff; font-weight:bold; font-style:italic">Better UX</c><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff">: User scrolls or click “ next page” instead of waiting for evrything. </c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="465" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; bgcolor:ffffff"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="461" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; bgcolor:ffffff">Pagination = breaking result into pages, this package helps us to do that for mongoDB aggtregative queries. </c><c props="font-style:normal; bgcolor:ffffff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="466" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; bgcolor:ffffff"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="468" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ffffff; font-weight:bold; font-style:normal">How to use in model. </c><c props="bgcolor:ffffff; font-weight:bold; font-style:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="469" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; bgcolor:ffffff"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="470" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; bgcolor:ffffff">Suppose we have video model, where we will have multiple videos stored so we will use </c><c props="font-style:normal; bgcolor:ffffff"></c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">mongoose-aggregate-paginate-v2 in this model.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="475" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="482" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">//code as below</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="481" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="476" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">import mongoose, { Schema } from "mongoose";<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="477" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">import mongooseAggregatePaginate from "mongoose-aggregate-paginate-v2";</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="478" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">const videoSchema = new Schema({},{});<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="479" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">videoSchema.plugin(mongooseAggregatePaginate);</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="480" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">export const Video = mongoose.model(“Video”, videoSchema)<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="471" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="483" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="484" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">***********************************************</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="485" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">Some more libraries:</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="486" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="487" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">node.bcrypt.js - This library help you hash the password. <c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="489" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="490" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">jsonwebtoken - JWT, <c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="492" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="493" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">In order to use above features into the code do below. </c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="494" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="495" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">1. These feature / action will be run before sving data in database and after user perfoam save operation. </c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="497" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="496" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal">user clicked on save = &gt; middleware =&gt; database operation performaed and saved date.</c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="467" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; bgcolor:ffffff"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="498" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ffffff; font-weight:bold; font-style:normal">2. use mongoose middleware.</c><c props="bgcolor:ffffff; font-weight:bold; font-style:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="499" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ffffff; font-weight:bold; font-style:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="500" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ffffff; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"> use Pre hook of mongoosse middleware to perform actions, like encrypt password </c><c props="bgcolor:ffffff; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="501" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><a xlink:href="https://mongoosejs.com/docs/middleware.html#pre" xid="504">https://mongoosejs.com/docs/middleware.html#pre<c></c></a></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="505" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="506" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">3. <c></c><c props="font-weight:bold">bcrypt</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="507" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="508" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">userSchema.pre("save", async function (next) {</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="509" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">    //</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c><c props="font-weight:bold; bgcolor:ff80ff">check if password field modified, return if not password modified</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="510" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">  if (!this.isModified("password")) return next();</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="511" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">  this.password = bcrypt.hash(this.password, 10);</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="512" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">});</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="513" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="514" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">//</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c><c props="font-weight:bold; bgcolor:ff80ff">create a custom method to check if password is correct</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="515" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">userSchema.methods.isPasswordCorrect =  async function(password){</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="516" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">    return await bcrypt.compare(password, this.password);</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="517" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff">}</c><c props="bgcolor:ff80ff"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="518" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="519" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Heading 2" xid="520" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">4. JWT - JWT is bearer token. </p>
<p style="Normal" xid="521" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="522" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">JWT (JSON Web Token) is a compact, URL-safe token format used for securely transmitting information between client and server. </p>
<p style="Normal" xid="523" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="524" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">A JWT has three parts, separated by dots (.)</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="525" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="526" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">Header.Payload.Signature</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="527" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="528" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="529" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="530" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">Create secret tokens in .env file</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="531" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="532" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">ACCESS_TOKEN_SECRET=4a20780449da3e09f0f0ffdae1dc909cc884d96c08553a14402a8c066441f0bb<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="534" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRY=1d<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="535" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">REFRESH_TOKEN_SECRET=66b148fec838e56c717745baf0d0bde5c302c3d0836e6e7fcd9a5554cc62307e<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="536" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRY=10d<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="537" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="538" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">create a refresh token and access token into User model:</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="539" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="540" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">userSchema.methods.generateAccessToken = function(){<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="541" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">  return jwt.sign(<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="542" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">    {<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="543" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">      _id : this.id,<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="544" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">      email : this.email,<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="545" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">      username : this.username,<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="546" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">      fullName : this.fullName,<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="547" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">    },<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="548" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">    process.env.ACCESS_TOKEN_SECRET,<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="549" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">    {<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="550" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">      expiresIn:process.env.ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRY<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="551" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">    }<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="552" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">  )<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="553" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">}<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="554" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="555" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="556" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="557" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="558" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="559" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="560" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="561" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="562" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="563" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Heading 1" xid="564" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">How to upload file in backend<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="568" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="569" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">In order to upload the file, we can use the backend tool <c></c><c props="font-weight:bold">cloudnary</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="570" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="572" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">We need the below mentioned two packages<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="573" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">1. express fileuplaod<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="574" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">2. multer<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="575" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Heading 1" xid="577" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"> Getting started with cloudinary</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="579" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="580" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">Step1:</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="581" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="582" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal">Generate API Key:</c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="583" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="584" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">Step 2:<br/></c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c props="font-weight:normal"><br/>Choose your SDk</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="576" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="585" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">Step 3:</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="586" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"> </c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="587" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal">install cloudinary</c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="588" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic">npm install cloudinary</c><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="589" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="606" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">Step 4:</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="610" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">create a folder and file as below</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="646" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="647" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">folder- util</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="648" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">file - cloudinary.js</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="649" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="607" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">Import cloudinary:</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="608" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">import { v2 as cloudinary } from 'cloudinary';</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="609" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="590" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:normal">Step 5:</c><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="591" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="592" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal">Create cloudinary configuration</c><c props="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="593" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="600" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">cloudinary.config({ <c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="601" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">  cloud_name: process, <c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="602" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">  api_key: process.env.CLOUD_API_KEY, <c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="603" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">  api_secret: process.env.CLOUD_API_SECRET<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="604" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">});<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="605" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="594" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="595" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:normal">step 6:</c><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="596" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="597" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal">Uses, upload the images</c><c props="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="612" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="614" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal">Uploading the images first on server and then from server to cloudinary</c><c props="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="615" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal">So, we will be sharing the server path to cloudinary</c><c props="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="616" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="617" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:normal">Try - Catch</c><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="618" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal">try-catch will be used since file operation involved and it may create some issues</c><c props="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="620" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="621" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:normal">async - await</c><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="622" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal">Since we will upload images on third party server, this operation </c><c props="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="598" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="625" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">const ImageUpload = async(localFilePath) =&gt;{</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="628" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">try{</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="630" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">  <c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">const response = await cloudinary.uploader.upload(localFilePath, {resource_type:"auto”});</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="632" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">  console.log(“File upladed to the cloudnary succesfully”);</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="633" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">return response;</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="631" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c>}</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="629" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">catch(e){}</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="635" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">{</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="636" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"> //it will remove the locally saved temp files, if upload operation failed</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="634" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"> fs.unlinkSync(localFilePath);</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="626" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">  throw error;</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="627" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">}</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="639" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c>}</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="650" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="652" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">export {<c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">ImageUpload};</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="651" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="624" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="566" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c props="font-weight:bold">Step 7:</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="640" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal">Create a multer middleware </c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="642" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="643" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal">link - </c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c>https://expressjs.com/en/resources/middleware/multer.html</p>
<p style="Normal" xid="644" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="645" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">Create a folder and file as below:</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="653" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="654" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">src - middlewares - multer.middleware.js<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="655" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="658" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><br/><c props="font-style:italic">const storage = multer.diskStorage({</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="659" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">  destination: function (req, file, cb) {</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="660" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">    cb(null, '</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic">/public/temp</c><c props="font-style:italic">')</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="661" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">  },</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="662" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">  filename: function (req, file, cb) {</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="663" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">    cb(null, </c><c props="font-style:italic"></c><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic">file.originalname</c><c props="font-style:italic">)</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="664" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">  }</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="665" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic">})</c><c props="font-style:italic"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="666" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="667" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic">export </c><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic"></c><c props="font-style:italic">const upload = multer({ </c><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:italic">storage</c><c props="font-style:italic"> })</c><br/></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="668" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">from above code the heighlighted data as below:<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="669" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="670" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">/public/emp - </c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c props="font-weight:normal"> is the path we have provided to store the file on server and from here we will send file to cloudinary.</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="671" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="672" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">file.originalname  - </c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c props="font-weight:normal"> Here we can modify the name of the file before saving that on server. I have selected the originalname so it will save as it is. We have multiple other options to rename the file and store it will avoid the duplication of the file name. </c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="673" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="674" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">export - </c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c props="font-weight:normal"> we have exported the multer by passing the </c><c props="font-weight:bold">storage</c><c props="font-weight:normal"> which we have created for the multer.  </c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="675" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="676" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="677" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="678" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Heading 1" xid="679" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">Controllers <c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="705" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="706" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">Create a folder like this:<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="707" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="708" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="709" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">folder - Controller - user.controller.js<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="710" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="711" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr">We write the controller like as below<c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="712" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="713" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">const useController = (req, res) =&gt;{</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="714" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">   res.status(200).json({message:"OK”});</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="715" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c props="font-weight:bold">}</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="716" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="717" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal">The most effective way fo wriiting this controller flow is as below:</c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="718" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="719" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">Step 1: Create a syncHandler</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="720" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="735" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c props="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal">Folder - util- asyncHandler.js</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="734" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="721" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal">const asyncHandler= (handlerFunction) =&gt;{</c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="725" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal">return (res, res, next) =&gt;{Promise.resolve(handlerFunction(req, res)).catch((err)=&gt; next(err))}</c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="723" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c props="font-weight:normal">}</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="726" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="727" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal">export {asyncHandler}</c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="728" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="733" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal">// from above asyncHandler if there is any error then it will be passed to the centralized error handler  middleware</c><c props="font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="732" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="729" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold">Step 2: Create centralized error hander midleware</c><c props="font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="730" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="731" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal">Folder - middlewares - errohandler.middleware.js</c><c props="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="739" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="740" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal">const errorHandler = (err, req,res, next) =&gt;{</c><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="741" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal">const statusCode =  err.status || 500;</c><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="743" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal">res.status(statusCode).json({message: err.message || “Internal Error”, stack:err.stack}) </c><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="742" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal"></c><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal">}</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="744" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal"></c><c></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="745" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal">export {errorHandler}</c><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="746" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="747" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-weight:bold; font-style:normal">Step 3: Create controller by inserting </c><c props="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold">asynchHandler</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="748" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:italic; font-weight:bold"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="749" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal"> Folder - controllers - user.controller.js</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="751" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="752" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal">const userController = asyncHandler(req, res, next)=&gt;{</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="755" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal">  res.status(200).json({message:"OK”});</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="756" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal"></c><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal">}</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="757" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="758" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal">export {userController}</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="759" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="765" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="766" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal">--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="767" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="768" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Heading 1" xid="769" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal">Logic Building</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="770" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="771" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal">The steps in logic involed:</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="772" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="773" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal">1. Get the user details from frontend</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="774" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal">2. Validation - Check if not empty etc etc </c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="775" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal">3. Check if that room category already exist</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="776" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal">4. check for images if uplaoded on server or not</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="777" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal">5. upload images to cloudinary and check if uploaded succesfully on cloudinary or not</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="780" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal">6. Create a room category object - create entry in db</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="784" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal">7. Remove password and refresh token feild from response. </c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="785" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal">8. Check for room category creation</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="786" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal">9. return res</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="783" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="787" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-style:normal"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="788" props="left-shadow-color:grey; right-space:0.02in; toc-label-type1:numeric; toc-label-type2:numeric; toc-label-type3:numeric; toc-label-type4:numeric; border-shadow-merge:0; border-merge:0; line-height:1.0; text-folded:0; top-shadow:0; list-decimal:.; list-delim:%L; margin-left:0pt; keep-with-next:no; top-space:0.02in; bot-shadow:0; right-shadow:0; toc-page-type3:numeric; orphans:2; toc-has-label2:1; start-value:1; toc-heading:Contents; toc-source-style1:Heading 1; toc-source-style2:Heading 2; toc-source-style3:Heading 3; toc-source-style4:Heading 4; toc-tab-leader1:dot; margin-right:0pt; toc-tab-leader3:dot; toc-tab-leader4:dot; toc-label-inherits4:1; shading-pattern:0; shading-background-color:white; toc-indent1:0.5in; toc-indent2:0.5in; text-folded-id:0; toc-indent4:0.5in; margin-top:0pt; top-shadow-color:grey; list-tag:0; text-indent:0in; text-align:left; default-tab-interval:0.5in; toc-page-type1:numeric; toc-page-type2:numeric; toc-has-label1:1; toc-page-type4:numeric; toc-has-label3:1; toc-has-label4:1; toc-label-inherits1:1; bot-space:0.02in; keep-together:no; bot-shadow-color:grey; toc-label-start1:1; left-space:0.02in; right-shadow-color:grey; toc-dest-style1:Contents 1; widows:2; shading-foreground-color:white; toc-dest-style4:Contents 4; toc-tab-leader2:dot; toc-label-inherits2:1; left-shadow:0; toc-label-inherits3:1; toc-heading-style:Contents Header; toc-label-start2:1; toc-label-start3:1; toc-label-start4:1; toc-dest-style2:Contents 2; toc-dest-style3:Contents 3; toc-has-heading:1; margin-bottom:0pt; dom-dir:ltr; format:%*%d.; toc-indent3:0.5in"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:24pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">1. Get the user details from frontend</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="789" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="790" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">Create a controller which will read the req.body and process thet information. <br/><br/>examples:<br/><br/>const addUser = asyncHandler((req,res, next)=&gt;{</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="791" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">      const {name. email, password } = req.body;</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="792" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US"></c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">})</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="793" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="794" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">export default addUser;</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="795" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="798" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-size:12pt; .:000000; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; lang:en-US">In above example this controller will be passed to router , where router will invoke the </c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; text-decoration:none; .:000000; font-weight:bold; font-style:italic; lang:en-US">post</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-size:12pt; .:000000; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; lang:en-US"> request. </c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="799" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-size:12pt; .:000000; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; lang:en-US"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="800" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; text-decoration:none; .:000000; font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">Router logic:</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="801" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; text-decoration:none; .:000000; font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; lang:en-US"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="807" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-size:12pt; .:000000; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">import addUser from ‘../controllers/addUser.controller.js";</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="802" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-size:12pt; .:000000; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">import express from “express”;</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="804" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-size:12pt; .:000000; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">const router = express.Router();</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="805" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-size:12pt; .:000000; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="806" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-size:12pt; .:000000; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">router.post(“/user”, addUser)</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="796" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="808" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">export default  router;</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="809" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="810" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; text-decoration:none; color:000000; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">S</c><c props=":000000; text-decoration:none; lang:en-US; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; font-family:Times New Roman">er</c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; 6:000000; text-decoration:none; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">ve</c><c props="":000000; text-decoration:none; lang:en-US; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; font-family:Times New Roman">r.js</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="811" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="":000000; text-decoration:none; lang:en-US; font-size:12pt; text-position:normal; font-weight:bold; font-style:normal; font-family:Times New Roman"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="818" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="":000000; text-decoration:none; lang:en-US; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-family:Times New Roman; font-style:normal; font-size:12pt">import userRouter from “./Router/userRouter.js”;</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="812" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="":000000; font-size:12pt; text-decoration:none; lang:en-US; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; font-family:Times New Roman"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="817" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="":000000; font-size:12pt; text-decoration:none; lang:en-US; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; font-family:Times New Roman"></c><c props="":000000; font-size:12pt; text-decoration:none; lang:en-US; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:italic; font-family:Times New Roman">//Need middleware to process the json data</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="813" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="":000000; text-decoration:none; lang:en-US; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-family:Times New Roman; font-style:normal; font-size:12pt"></c><c props="":000000; text-decoration:none; lang:en-US; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-family:Times New Roman; font-style:normal; font-size:12pt">app.use(express.json());</c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="815" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="":000000; text-decoration:none; lang:en-US; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-family:Times New Roman; font-style:normal; font-size:12pt"></c></p>
<p style="Normal" xid="819" props="text-align:left; dom-dir:ltr"><c props="":000000; text-decoration:none; lang:en-US; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-family:Times New Roman; font-style:normal; font-size:12pt">app.use(“/api”, </c><c props="font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:12pt; color:000000; text-decoration:none; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-style:normal; lang:en-US">userRouter</c><c props="":000000; text-decoration:none; lang:en-US; text-position:normal; font-weight:normal; font-family:Times New Roman; font-style:normal; font-size:12pt">);</c></p>
